  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "からだから　あくいに\nみちた　おそろしい　オーラを　はっする。\nあいてを　ひるませる　ことが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "몸에서 악의로 가득한\n무서운 오라를 발한다.\n상대를 풀죽게 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從身體散發出\n充滿惡意的恐怖氣場。\n有時會使對手畏縮。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur dégage une horrible aura chargée\nde pensées maléfiques. Peut aussi apeurer l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender greift mit fürchterlicher Aura schlechter\nGedanken an. Ziel schreckt eventuell zurück.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Libera una horrible aura llena de malos pensamientos\nque puede amedrentar al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa emana un’aura impregnata di oscuri pensieri.\nPuò anche far tentennare il Pokémon colpito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user releases a horrible aura imbued with dark\nthoughts. This may also make the target flinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "体から　悪意に　みちた\n恐ろしい　オーラを　発する。\n相手を　ひるませることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从体内发出\n充满恶意的恐怖气场。\n有时会使对手畏缩。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Libera una horrible aura llena de malos pensamientos\nque puede amedrentar al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
